{
  "uid": "calculatorgaz-traces",
  "title": "CalculatorGaz · Traces",
  "tags": ["calculatorgaz", "production", "tempo", "traces"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "description": "RED metrics are generated by the OpenTelemetry Collector from every sanitized CalculatorGaz span, before tail sampling; Tempo stores only the sampled traces. Use Explore > Tempo with { resource.service.name = \\\"calculatorgaz\\\" } to inspect an individual trace.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Trace traffic",
      "description": "Spans per second across all CalculatorGaz spans, measured before sampling.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\"}[5m]))", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 2 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Trace errors",
      "description": "Error spans per second.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m]))", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Trace error rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "100 * sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\"}[5m])), 0.001)", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "decimals": 2, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "p95 span latency",
      "description": "95th percentile duration of all CalculatorGaz spans, measured before sampling.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\"}[5m])))", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 3 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Trace throughput and errors",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "all spans/s", "refId": "A" },
        { "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "error spans/s", "refId": "B" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 7 }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "p95 latency over time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "p95", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 3 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 7 }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Top operations by trace volume",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "topk(10, sum by (span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}", "instant": true, "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Operations with trace errors",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum by (span_name, http_route, http_response_status_code) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service_name=\"calculatorgaz\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m]))", "format": "table", "instant": true, "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 3 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Open traces in Tempo",
      "type": "text",
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "### Investigate a request\n\nOpen **Explore → Tempo** and use one of these TraceQL queries:\n\n- Recent CalculatorGaz traces: `{ resource.service.name = \"calculatorgaz\" }`\n- Error traces: `{ resource.service.name = \"calculatorgaz\" && status = error }`\n- Slow traces over one second: `{ resource.service.name = \"calculatorgaz\" && duration > 1s }`\n\nTrace attributes are sanitized by the OpenTelemetry Collector: authorization, cookies, full URL and path are removed before Tempo stores them." },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 }
    }
  ]
}
